wf-lobby-shenanigans-moproach-rain = Moproach rain
wf-lobby-shenanigans-moproach-rain-tooltip = A dozen moproaches tumble in from the top of the lobby and pile up at the bottom.
wf-lobby-shenanigans-carp-migration = Carp migration
wf-lobby-shenanigans-carp-migration-tooltip = A school of rainbow space carp swims across the lobby. Click one and it bites. They barge straight through any moproaches.
wf-lobby-shenanigans-singularity = Singularity
wf-lobby-shenanigans-singularity-tooltip = A singularity forms in the lobby, wanders about and grows, eating any moproaches and carp it can reach, then collapses. Set it off again to feed it a level.
